Légifrance and Judilibre data
-----------------------------

The files under test/fixtures/ are responses from two French public APIs,
recorded from production through the PISTE portal (https://piste.gouv.fr)
between 12 and 14 November 2026. Only the offline tests read them; they are
not part of the npm package or the Claude Desktop bundle.

- test/fixtures/legifrance/: Légifrance, published by the Direction de
  l'information légale et administrative (DILA), https://www.legifrance.gouv.fr
- test/fixtures/judilibre/: Judilibre, published by the Cour de cassation,
  https://www.courdecassation.fr

They are reused under the Licence Ouverte / Open Licence 2.0 (Etalab):
